.TH SIMPLE_SHELL 1 "May 2026" "1.0" "Simple Shell Manual"

.SH NAME
simple_shell \- simple UNIX command interpreter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./hsh

.SH DESCRIPTION
simple_shell is a simple shell that reads commands from the user and executes them.
It supports commands with arguments, PATH handling, and built-in commands.

.SH USAGE
Run the shell using:
.B ./hsh

.SH EXAMPLES
($) ls
($) /bin/ls -l
($) env
($) exit

.SH BUILTINS
exit - exit the shell
env - print environment variables

.SH FILES
shell.c - main shell file
shell.h - header file
path.c - PATH handling

